--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8eb9d9fa0ccbe1b4cbcd2a1d889b806b, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstDayConvo05
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  conversationName: FirstDayMainConversation
  lines:
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: After you use that key, you can </b>come back to get another one from me<b>.
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: I will only be giving you one room key at a time, in accordance with our
      policy. I'm sick of people losing them, and you don't exactly look... well,
      competent.
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: After you enter a guest room and harvest materials from the guest, <b>bring
      the goods</b> you harvested <b>to the back room of the gift shop to sell them
      to waiting customers</b>.
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: "If you haven\u2019t found it already, the <b>gift shop</b> is located
      <b>to the right as you enter the hotel.</b> Yes, <b>down that long hallway.</b>"
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: "If you can\u2019t carry everything you harvested from the guest rooms
      down to the gift shop in one trip, use the <b>housekeeping cart</b>. Just pick
      up and place the materials onto it."
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: The <b>cart</b> should be in the lobby somewhere. If you find it, you can
      go up to the handle and hold onto it to push it around.
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: "Oh yes-- and one final thing. Once you\u2019ve reached your quota, make
      sure <b>to finish your shift by clocking out at the front door of the hotel
      before the clock hits 8:00am.</b>"
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: "<b>Clocking out will turn in your quota money</b> and let you finish your
      shift successfully. <b>It\u2019s very important to clock out at the front door
      before 8:00am</b>-- or the money you made won\u2019t be counted."
  - speakerName: Randy
    line: Now then, enough chatter! Get to work, the clock is ticking.
  repeatLine:
    speakerName: Randy
    line: "You\u2019ve got the room key, the room is waiting, and the guest is...
      well, not going anywhere. Go on."
  altRepeatLine:
    speakerName: Randy
    line: "Here is the next room key. It\u2019s a little sticky. Don\u2019t worry
      about why."
